parameters.text:
==Draft a high-converting, technical proposal email reply for the incoming business inquiry below.

MANDATORY FIRST STEP: Call the Pinecone Vector Store Tool using the snippet provided below to fetch relevant technical context and RAG architecture experience.

EMAIL DETAILS:
- Sender Name & Email: {{ $('Edit Fields').item.json.From }}
- Subject Line: {{ $('Edit Fields').item.json.Subject }}
- Email Content: {{ $('Edit Fields').item.json.snippet }}
- Thread ID: {{ $('Edit Fields').item.json.threadId }}

OUTPUT REQUIREMENTS:
Draft a personalized response confirming expertise in secure internal document RAG pipelines, LangChain integrations, and offer next steps to discuss their enterprise project.

parameters.jsCode:
const rawText = $input.first().json.output;

// Extract Subject (captures text between **Subject:** and the first newline)
const subjectMatch = rawText.match(/\*\*Subject:\*\*\s*(.*?)\s*\n/i);
const subject = subjectMatch ? subjectMatch[1].trim() : "Re: Your Inquiry";

// Extract Body (captures text between **Body:** and **End of response** or end of string)
let body = "";
const bodyMatch = rawText.match(/\*\*Body:\*\*\s*([\s\S]*?)(?=\n---\s*\n\*\*End of response\*\*|$)/i);

if (bodyMatch) {
  body = bodyMatch[1].trim();
} else {
  // Fallback if formatting varies slightly
  body = rawText.replace(/\*\*Subject:\*\*\s*.*?\n/i, "").replace(/\*\*Body:\*\*/i, "").trim();
}

return {
  json: {
    subject: subject,
    message: body
  }
};

